 # Runs an Oz cloud agent when an issue receives a ready-to-implement label.
 # The agent follows .agents/skills/implementation/SKILL.md to implement the issue,
 # open a pull request, and report progress back to the original issue.
+#
+# Setup (Caretaker runs the agent in place of Oz): the CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN
+# repository secret must be set: your Claude subscription token, from
+# `claude setup-token`. The agent works in a sandbox that cannot push; it
+# writes .caretaker/pr.md and the Caretaker step opens the pull request.
 
 on:
   issues:
